  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Economic Strengthening of Host and Refugee Populations in Ethiopia (DAI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SHARPE (Strengthening Host and Refugee Populations in Ethiopia) adopts an innovative approach to building refugee economies which aims to support more sustainable markets in and around refugee camps and create improved economic opportunities for both host communities and refugees.</narrative>
